{
  "chapter": "STEAM_AGE",
  "description": "The §6Large Steam Compressor§r uses steam pressure to quickly compress weaker materials, especially §aRubber§r. It's a bit pricey on fiery bronze, but I §a§lHIGHLY§r recommend it§r. Maybe you'll find other uses!

(A word to the wise, you can make dense steel plates in a singleblock compressor)


